            "detailed_description": "Will you be able to fully explore each maze always bigger and find the key that will get you out?<br />\r\nCollect as many gold coins as you can to buy aids in the store that will help you defeat the stronger Slimes at each level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you become the best Lost In Maze player?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 20 mazes on 3 levels of difficulty, 60 mazes in total.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Each maze is procedurally generated and of increasing size depending on the level (starting with a 5x5 size)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 5 Slimes types with 3 levels of difficulty (15 various Slimes !)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Steam Achievements<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Steam Cloud",
